---
// The brand wordmark for the printed-QR landing pages: the same open-book
// mark and "LogicManse Publications" name as the site header, drawn for a
// light page (navy mark, forest-green "Publications"). These pages are
// deliberately standalone — no site nav, because a reader who has just
// scanned a QR code has one thing to do — but they still carry the brand.
---

<a class="qr-logo" href="/">
  <img src="/logo-mark-192.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" style="border-radius:6px" class="rounded-md" />
  <span>LogicManse <em>Publications</em></span>
</a>

<style>
  .qr-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: Merriweather, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #0b1f3a;
  }
  .qr-logo em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: #1f6f4a;
  }
</style>
